silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_02_concrete_anchor_1#microchipidentifier9 silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipIdentifier9 is the 15-hex-character literal string read off the chip on 2026-04-19. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MicrochipIdentifier9', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
